puter files over a network that does not require the sender and recipient to be online at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50197">electronic mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634505">ඉලෙක්ට්‍රොනික තැපෑල</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10041_50197_634773"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of exchanging messages and computer files over a network that does not require the sender and recipient to be online at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50197">electronic mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634773">මේල්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10041_725782_1520643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of exchanging messages and computer files over a network that does not require the sender and recipient to be online at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="725782">email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520643">ඊමේල්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramm