g in relation to other animation events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139748">Custom Animation list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913121">අභිමත සජීවීකරණ ලැයිස්තුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10828_245217_634593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A monitoring option in real-time spyware protection that monitors various types and areas of software activity on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="245217">agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634593">කාරකය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10839_2108_635399"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A row, column, or block of buttons or icons, usually displayed across the top of the screen, that represent tasks or commands within the program. The toolbar buttons provide shortcuts to common tasks frequently accessed from the menus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2108">toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635399">මෙවලම් තීරුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10841_180035_635893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standard Windows control that is similar to a standard text box, except that it also supports individual character and paragraph properties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180035">rich-text box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635893">සරු පෙළ කොටුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10853_14662_1913039"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formula that performs multiple calculations on one or more sets of values, and then returns either a single result or multiple results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="14662">array formula</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913039">ආරා සූත්‍රය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10864_141438_1913132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that is placed on a worksheet rather than on a separate chart sheet. Embedded charts are beneficial when you want to view or print a chart or a PivotChart report with its source data or other information in a worksheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141438">embedded chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913132">තිළැලි ප්‍රස්ථාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10871_30752_1370278"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic or diagram that displays data or the relationships between sets of data in pictorial rather than numeric form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30752">chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370278">ප්‍රස්තාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10894_225713_634980"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that can be opened to reveal all choices for a given field.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="225713">drop-down list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634980">පතන ලැයිස්තුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10894_47518