">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634681">ගොනු විබෙදුම් වගුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11318_232416_634940"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that includes the email addresses of mailing lists for which you want to be a recipient. Messages sent to such a mailing list and received by you will not be treated as junk email.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232416">Safe Recipients List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634940">නිරාපද ලබන්නන් ලැයිස්තුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11319_168226_1368755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security feature that monitors programs on a computer to determine if they use system memory safely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168226">Data Execution Prevention</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368755">දත්ත ක්‍රියාකරවීම වැලැක්වීම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEnt