ilitates collaborative editing and file management between users located remotely from each other on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="690956">World Wide Web Distributed Authoring and Versioning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370305">WebDAV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12442_690956_1913402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of extensions to the Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP) that facilitates collaborative editing and file management between users located remotely from each other on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="690956">World Wide Web Distributed Authoring and Versioning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913402">විශ්ව විසිරි වියමන හරහා බෙදාහරින කර්තෘභාවය හා සංස්කරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12442_690956_635723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of extensions to the Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP) that facilitates collaborative editing and file management between users located remotely from each other on the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="690956">World Wide Web Distributed Authoring and Versioning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><ter