e as possible, so as to create as much continuous free space as possible.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36190">compaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2699412">සුසංහසනය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12659_81864_635385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A predefined command for a single mouse click or a double mouse click, with or without a modifier key, that can be used to perform a task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81864">mouse shortcut</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635385">මූසික කෙටිමඟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12666_50449_1913054"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The state of an uninitialized Variant variable (which returns a VarType of 0).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50449">empty</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913054">ශූන්‍ය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1267_314102_636017"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Shading made up of regularly spaced, intersecting lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="314102">hatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="636017">හරස් ඉරි</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1267_314102_636019"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Shading made up of regularly spaced, intersecting lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="314102">hatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="636019">හරස්කඩ රේඛනය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1267_40948_636017"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Shading made up of regularly spaced, intersecting lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="40948">cross hatch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="636017">හරස් ඉරි</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singul