geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14219_310257_1370325"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows technology that protects OS resources (files, folders registry keys) and prevents applications and administrators from making changes to a computer's resources in an arbitrary way.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310257">System Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370325">පද්ධති ආරක්ෂණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14232_231970_635683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that provides interactive analysis of data, like a PivotTable report. You can change views of data, see different levels of detail, or reorganize the chart layout by dragging fields and by showing or hiding items in fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231970">PivotChart report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635683">විවර්තන ප්‍රස්තාර වාර්තාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14237_169312_2812304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip ty