) and converts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="321896">Calculator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2195031">Microsoft කැල්ක්‍යුලේටරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14622_321896_634613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that calculates (standard and scientific) and converts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="321896">Calculator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634613">කැල්ක්‍යුලේ‍ටරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14623_149387_1913186"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A scheme for uniquely identifying resources that may be available on the Internet by name, without regard to where they are located.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149387">Uniform Resource Name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913186">ඒකීය සම්පත් නාමය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></te