Number">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16414_583814_2576109"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of an integrated development environment (IDE) that provides logical code elements that the user can select from a drop-down menu while coding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="583814">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2576109">IntelliSense</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16438_584264_1913312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares values across categories. The categories are organized horizontally, and values vertically, to emphasize variation over time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584264">clustered column chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913312">වෙන්කළ ටැඹ ප්‍රස්තාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16439_584277_1913314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A column chart subtype that compares the percentage that each value contributes to a total across categories.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="584277">100% stacked column chart</term><termNote type="partOfS