rm id="93814">portrait</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368617">සිරස්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="197_93814_635958"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An orientation where the long dimension of a rectangular area (for example, screen, photo, or paper) is vertical.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93814">portrait</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635958">සිරස් දිශානතිය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19723_673395_1368867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on most digital cameras that lets you control the under -or over- exposure of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="673395">exposure bias</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368867">නිරාවරණ නැඹුරු හානිපූරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19723_686810_1368867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on most digital cameras that lets you control the under -or over- exposure of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="686810">exposure bias compensation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368867">නිරාවරණ නැඹුරු හානිපූරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19723_686811_1368867"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on most digital cameras that lets you control the under -or over- exposure of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="686811">exposure compensation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368867">නිරාවරණ නැඹුරු හානිපූරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="19729_1309629_1913575"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">When a ribbon is divided into multiple views, any one of the views. Every tab contains functionally related commands and other controls that are organized in groups. Typically, ribbon tabs are labeled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1309629">ribbon tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="19135