>Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913606">සෞඛ්‍ය විශ්ලේෂක</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29474_1508825_1913608"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom handler that calls and runs custom code during the creation process for a site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508825">site provisioning provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913608">ස්ථාන ප්‍රතිපාදන සැපයුම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29476_1508830_2290364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office program that you can use to organize related documents. You can check spelling, number pages consecutively across all documents in the binder, and print the documents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508830">Binder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290364">බඳින්නා</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29480_1508864_1913610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contiguous piece of text or string of characters sharing the same attributes. All characters in a run have the same directional properties.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508864">run</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913610">සමගුණ අක්ෂර මාලාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29481_1508936_1913611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A reading order and alignment setting that is commonly used in controls that display text. When you select the Context setting, the reading order is determined by the first strong character (not a numeral or special character) that you type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508936">Context</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913611">සන්දර්භය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29483_1508938_1913612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In an outline, to change a heading to body text or to a lower heading level: for example, to change from Heading 5 to Heading 6.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508938">demote</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammat