 of Hotmail email, calendar, and contacts from within Outlook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1579321">Outlook Connector Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1588791">Outlook සම්බන්ධක කට්ටලය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3098_228472_634697"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A written order on a bank to pay a sum of money from funds in an account. Checks show the name of the company or individual receiving payment, the signature and account number of the person issuing the check, the payment amount and the current date. Checks usually are numbered in sequence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228472">check</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634697">චෙක්පත</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="30985_1579880_1588784"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Someone with whom a user has established a mutual social relationship.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1579880">connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1588784">සම්බන්ධතාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsag