uded in Windows and is used by several Windows Services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1600001">WID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1695399">WID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31334_1676496_1681084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that assembles a composite photo collage from multiple source photos.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676496">Auto Collage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1681084">ඔටෝ කොලාජ්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31335_1600004_1649240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that verifies and eliminates lengthy chkdsk due to any transient errors that NTFS detects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1600004">Spot Verifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1649240">ස්ථානීය තහවුරු කරන්නා</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</