gn surface that enables users to create and edit workflows visually by manipulating shapes that represent actions and conditions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608229">Visual Designer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913630">දෘශ්‍ය නිර්මාණකරු</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31659_1608235_1640036"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The name of a product in the store that appears to customers. To the end user, this is the name of the product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608235">app name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1640036">යෙදු නම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31660_1608236_2242581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains the app manifest, executable files, text and image resource files, and other files that make up the app for a single platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608236">app package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242581">යෙදුම් ඇසුරුම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote typ