Grp><term id="1653518">ranking model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913780">ඇගයීම් මාදිලිය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32340_1653519_1913781"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that ensures that index replicas on the same index partition remain synchronized during regular operation and during recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653519">seeding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913781">බීජනය කරමින්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32341_1653521_1913782"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of managed properties that are updated together in the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653521">update group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913782">සමූහය යාවත්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32342_1653526_1913783"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be queried against. The query must contain the managed property field name, either in the query itself or programmatically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653526">queryable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913783">විමසිය හැකි පාලිත වත්කම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32343_1653528_1913784"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be used as the basis for a refiner for search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653528">refinable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913784">ප්‍රශස්ත කළ හැකි පාලිත වත්කම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32344_1653529_1913785"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be displayed in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653529">retrievable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913785">නැවත ලැබිය හැකි පාලිත වත්කම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32345_1653531_1913786"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose value can be returned by a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653531">searchable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913786">සෙවිය හැකි පාලිත වත්කම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32346_1653533_1913787"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose result set can be sorted based on the property before the result set is returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653533">sortable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913787">පෙළගැස්විය හැකි පාලිත වත්කම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32350_1656127_1913788"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user defined dictionary that lists single words or phrases that the system matches to words in the content in either a case-sensitive way or a case-insensitive way, depending on the type of dictionary that is used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656127">custom extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913788">අභිමත උපුටන ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32351_1656134_1913789"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" to "anchor," but not to "Anchor" or "Anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656134">exact word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913789">නිශ්චිත වදන උපුටාගන්නා ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32352_1656137_1913790"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" and "anchorage," but not "Anchor."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656137">exact word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913790">නිශ්චිත වදන් කොටස උපුටාගන්නා ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32353_1656140_1913791"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor" and "Anchor," but not "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656140">word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913791">වදන් උපුටන ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32354_1656141_1913792"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor," "Anchor," and "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656141">word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913792">වදන් කොටස් උපුටන ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32355_1656142_1913793"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data structure that describes crawled properties, managed properties, and the mapping between them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656142">search schema</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913793">සෙවුම් ප්‍රකාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32356_1656144_1913794"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical portion of the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656144">index partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913794">සූචි කොටස</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32359_1657886_1662404"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of apps that includes Messenger, Photo Gallery, Movie Maker, OneDrive, Mail, Writer, and Family Safety. (Family Safety is only included in Windows 7 downloads; it's built in to Windows 8.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657886">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1662404">Windows අත්‍යවශ්‍යතා 2012</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32362_1658249_1913796"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which SharePoint Server is the primary source for all the project details. Project Server scheduling, time and status, and advanced functionality are disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658249">visibility mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913796">දර්ශක ප්‍රකාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32367_1666384_1686839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that enables users to connect computers with a simple tap gesture or by browsing for computers within wireless range. If two computers come within 3-4 centimeters of each other, or are tapped together, the operating system of each computer becomes aware of the other computer. Also, a user can browse for computers within wireless range that are advertising for a peer connection. The user can then connect the two computers to share content such as photos or links, or create a multi-player experience. If the connection is made using a tap gesture, the user can also publish and subscribe to messages transmitted during the tap.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1666384">proximity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1686839">ආසන්නතාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1644992"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644992">අතරමැදි CA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3239_1513455_1644997"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A certification authority that has the ability to issue the intermediate certificates needed to certify the subject identified by the end certificate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1513455">intermediate CA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1644997">අතරමැදි සහතිකකරණ බලාධිකාරිය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lan