icalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33625_1805619_2077983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of information supplied by the user that appears in the mood panel beside the user's Skype Name for other users to see.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805619">mood message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077983">ස්වභාව පණිවුඩය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33626_1805620_2077984"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field next to the user's Skype Name for typing a mood message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805620">mood panel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077984">ස්වභාව පුවරුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33627_1805621_2077981"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A client service where users can ask for help via a live chat and a customer support agent will answer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805621">live chat customer support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077981">සජීවි පිළිසඳර පාරිභෝගික සහාය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33628_1805623_2078013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique username for logging on to Skype software or Skype-linked accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805623">Skype Name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2078013">Skype නම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33629_1805626_2077993"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of paid account that includes access to enhanced Skype features such as group video calling, group screen sharing, and live chat customer support.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805626">Premium account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077993">Premium ගිණුම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33631_1805629_2350323"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descr