 that allows calls with at least three Skype users where at least one participant shows video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805815">group video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077971">කණ්ඩායම් වීඩියෝ ඇමතුම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33644_1859273_2077970"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows calls with at least three Skype users where at least one participant shows video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1859273">group video calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077970">කණ්ඩායම් වීඩියෝ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33644_1859273_2077971"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows calls with at least three Skype users where at least one participant shows video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1859273">group video calling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2077971">කණ්ඩායම් වීඩියෝ ඇමතුම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNot