tion">The feature that brings together browser history and favorite content into one place for fast and easy access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2207458">Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2210287">මධ්‍යස්ථානය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38290_2208745_2796387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user-presented recommendation based on an analysis of the user's data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2208745">insight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2796387">විදසුන</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38321_2209216_2236192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The group of Excel add-ins that support data analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2209216">Data Analysis</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2236192">දත්ත විශ්ලේෂණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38336_2781061_2782505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cloud communications service that connects people. Skype for Business Online provides intuitive communications capabilities across presence, instant messaging, audio/video calling, and an online meeting experience that includes audio, video, and web conferencing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2781061">Skype for Business on the web</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2782505">වෙබයෙහි ව්‍යාපාරය සඳහා Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38348_2221503_2236193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button in Sway that allows users to emphasize or deemphasize content in relationship to other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2221503">Emphasize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2236193">අවධාරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3838_47370_634475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A toolbar that is attached to one edge of the program window. When you drag a toolbar below the program title bar or to the left, right, or bottom edge of the window, the toolbar snaps into place on the edge of the program window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47370">docked toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634475">ඈඳුන මෙවලම් තීරුව‍</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38399_2223248_2236195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway Design feature that allows users to change the navigation and layout model of a particular Sway document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2223248">Structure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2236195">ව්‍යුහය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38416_2226110_2233199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that is installed as part of the MultiPoint role on server and ensures that some MultiPoint configuration settings remain set to keep Windows MultiPoint Server running smoothly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2226110">Windows MultiPoint Server Repair Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233199">Windows MultiPoint Server අළුත්වැඩියා සේවාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38419_2227157_2232968"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A keypad that is available in Programmer mode, which allows the user to look at numbers represented as various combinations of 1s and 0s, and to toggle between 1 and 0 for each binary bit to form a new number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227157">bit toggling keypad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2232968">බිටු ටොගලන යතුරු ඵලකය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38420_2227158_2232972"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of thematically related apps, games, music tracks, videos, or other items available for purchase or download in the Store. A thematic group of editorially chosen apps and games for merchandising or marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227158">Collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2232972">එකතුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38421_2227159_2232975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to select a color and increase or decrease the vibrancy of that color in an image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227159">color boost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2232975">වර්ණ විහිදුවනය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38422_2227160_2790901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu invoked with a shortcut key (Windows + G) when gaming that allows users to take a screenshot, take a 30 second clip of a game, and adjust volume controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227160">Game Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2790901">Xbox Game Bar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38422_2227160_2791387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu invoked with a shortcut key (Windows + G) when gaming that allows users to take a screenshot, take a 30 second clip of a game, and adjust volume controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227160">Game Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2791387">Game Bar</term><termNote typ