ender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40653_2358634_2436246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a shortcut to an application or part of an application from the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358634">unpin from Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436246">ඇරඹුමෙන් ඇමුණුම ඉවතට</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40657_2358714_2364212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that use a map and colors to reflect characteristics specific to a particular geographical location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358714">map chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364212">සිතියම් ප්‍රස්තාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40677_2359171_2364214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tool that allows users to import Evernote notes into OneNote.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359171">OneNote Importer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNot