ote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4068_536518_634038"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integral Windows component that supports building, deploying, and running the next generation of applications and XML Web services. It provides a highly productive, standards-based, multilanguage environment for integrating existing investments with next generation applications and services, as well as the agility to solve the challenges of deployment and operation of Internet-scale applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="536518">Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634038">.NET සැකිල්ල</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40683_2360130_2362286"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for TV shows that are in the top N% of sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360130">Top-selling TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362286">මුදුන් විකිණෙන TV සංදර්ශන</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40684_2360133_2362233"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Not containing any ads being played beforehand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360133">ad-free</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362233">දැන්වීම් රහිත</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40685_2360134_2362238"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The metadata about the song in a music album, such as genre, artist, year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360134">album info</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362238">ඇල්බම තොරතුරු</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40686_2360135_2362239"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The credits for a movie or TV show including the main actors, actresses, directors, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360135">cast and crew</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362239">කාස්ට් ඇන්ඩ් කෲ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp>