choose the color, thickness, and style that they want their ink to appear as.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397415">Draw</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405829">අඳින්න</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42394_2397416_2405832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint Designer feature that scans users' text for well-defined structures, such as timelines or processes, and converts them to visual representations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397416">Text to SmartArt</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405832">SmartArt වෙත පෙළ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4240_152004_634211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The protocol within TCP/IP that governs the breakup of data messages into packets to be sent via IP, and the reassembly and verification of the complete messages from packets received by IP.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="152004">Transmission Control Protocol</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634211">TCP</term><te