Selected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43065_2439459_2445210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A control on a shape that allows users to resize, move, or deform the shape.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439459">object handle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445210">වස්තු හසුරුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43066_2440378_2445212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of distinct objects where each object cannot appear more than once.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440378">set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2445212">කට්ටලය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43068_2440726_2443008"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A record of the software updates installed in the product.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440726">update history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2443008">යාවත්කාල ඉතිහාසය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun<