88">විවෘත උධෘත ලකුණ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4384_319146_1368670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The “ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319146">LEFT DOUBLE QUOTATION MARK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368670">ආරම්භක රැලි උද්ධෘත ලකුණ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4384_319146_635688"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The “ character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319146">LEFT DOUBLE QUOTATION MARK</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635688">විවෘත උධෘත ලකුණ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43879_2473454_2480204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Holograms app that allows the user to input text and have that text become a hologram that they can place in their space. User inputs text to make a holographic label.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473454">holographic label maker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480204">හොලෝග්‍රැෆික් ලේබල් සාදනය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43880_2473560_2480206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Microsoft HoloLens hardware and software released for developers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473560">Microsoft HoloLens Development Edition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480206">Microsoft HoloLens Development Edition</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43881_2473564_2480205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of HoloLens sold for organizations. Includes the HoloLens Development Edition hardware, plus a warranty and enterprise features for added security and device management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473564">Microsoft HoloLens Commercial Suite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480205">Microsoft HoloLens Commercial Suite</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43905_2475911_2480209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action or mechanism to explicitly consent to participate in programs or offerings, typically for marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475911">opt-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480209">තෝරාගන්න</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43906_2475967_2480210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action or mechanism to explicitly decline to participate in programs or offerings, typically for marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2475967">opt-out</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480210">තේරීම ඉවත් කරන්න</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43977_2481084_2483187"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Holographic SKU that runs on the HoloLens Commercial Suite, when an Enterprise license is applied to the device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2481084">Windows Holographic for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483187">Windows Holographic for Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43992_2481238_2483177"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An e-book file format with the extension .epub that can be downloaded and read on devices like smartphones, tablets, computers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2481238">EPUB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483177">EPUB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43993_2481249_2485800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic UI control consisting of a string of horizontal stars that allows users to report their level of satisfaction with a product, service, or experience and that visually indicates the aggregated rating of all users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2481249">star rating</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485800">තරු ශ්‍රේණිගත කිරීම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43999_2481302_2482807"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The PowerPoint button that allows users to make poster frames for videos in their slides.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2481302">Poster Frame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482807">පෝස්ටර් රාමුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44000_2481303_2482806"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A static image that is a preview of a video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2481303">poster frame</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482806">පෝස්ටර් රාමුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4408_99874_2028438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To put back into a stable condition. A computer user may be able to recover lost or damaged data by using a program to search for and salvage whatever information remains in storage. A database may be recovered by restoring its integrity after some problem has damaged it, such as abnormal termination of the database management program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="99874">recover</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml