e whether it should be disposed of.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2580598">disposition review</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583266">සංවිහිති සමාලෝචනය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45831_2580607_2583269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A organized effort to spread malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2580607">malware campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583269">අනිෂ්ට මෘදුකාංග ප්‍රයත්නය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45832_2580609_2583270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organized effort to trick computer users into revealing information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2580609">phishing campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583270">තතුබෑම් ප්‍රයත්නය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45833_2581650_2583271">