</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46310_2608183_2610211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A web part that is offered as default for the design of a SharePoint communication site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608183">default hero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610211">සුපුරුදු වීරයා</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46325_2608792_2610210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint site created or managed by few people to broadcast information out to a broad audience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2608792">communication site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610210">සන්නිවේදන අඩවිය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46330_2609539_2663825"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that enables Cortana to take over your mouse pointer and literally show you how to change a setting when you ask her to "show me (how to do something)." She performs each step for 