n</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46353_2612185_2612942"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-friendly name for virtualization-based security (VBS). The VBS service in Windows 10 uses hardware virtualization features to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612185">Core isolation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612942">හර හුදෙකලාකරණය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46354_2612186_2612943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of open tabs, including applications, files, pages, or websites, which can be saved together and re-opened together when you want to continue with that set of tabs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612186">set</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2612943">සකසන්න</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4639_108282_1370216"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To move a document or other data in a window in order to view a particular portion of the document. Scrolling may be controlled by the mouse, arrow keys, or other keys on the keyboard, eventually with one or more fingers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="108282">scroll</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370216">අනුචලනය කරන්න</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46410_2613241_2805391"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A team in Microsoft Teams that is available for all users in an organization to join.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2613241">public team</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2805391">පොදු කණ්ඩායම</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4645_39469_1368674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows program that collects and displays for users the system-level features of the computer, including hardware and software setup and configuration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="39469">Control Panel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368674">පාලක පුවරුව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46478_2615085_2618767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The security feature that protects your device by providing startup and runtime protections that the operating system can validate and report on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2615085">System Guard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618767">පද්ධති ආරක්ෂක</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46479_2615093_2618770"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The remote attestation service that checks the health of Windows 10-based devices to allow or deny access to networks, apps, or services, based on whether devices prove to be healthy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2615093">Windows Health Attestation Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618770">Windows සෞඛ්ය සහතිකකරණ සේවාව</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46481_2615123_2618765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area in Windows Defender Security Center that helps customers keep their devices refreshed and up to date with the latest version of Windows 10. Device health advisor monitors the device and provides information and recommendations in a Health report to address common issues with storage capacity, device drivers, battery life, or Windows Update.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2615123">Device performance &amp; health</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618765">උපකරණ කාර්ය සාධනය සහ සෞඛ්යය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4649_50166_1913053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A typographical unit of measure that is equal in width to the point size of a particular font. For many fonts, this is equal to the width of a capital M, from which the em space takes its name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50166">em space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1913053">එම් ඉඩ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46505_2618212_2619421"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tenant that consists of a central location and one or more satellite geo locations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618212">Multi-Geo tenant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619421">බහු-භූ නියැසියා</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46511_2618261_2619420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The single web portal where Microsoft 365 admins can manage user accounts and settings for each of the Microsoft 365 services they subscribe to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618261">Microsoft 365 admin center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619420">Microsoft 365 පරිපාලක මධ්‍යස්ථානය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46511_2690503_2619420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The single web portal where Microsoft 365 admins can manage user accounts and settings for each of the Microsoft 365 services they subscribe to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2690503">Admin Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619420">Microsoft 365 පරිපාලක මධ්‍යස්ථානය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46512_2618262_2619315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Immersive Reader feature that shows a picture when you click on a word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618262">Picture Dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619315">පින්තූර ශබ්දකෝෂය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46514_2618265_2620542"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Excel mode where a user can move to the next nonblank cell in the same column or row as the active cell.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2618265">End mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2620542">සමාප්ති ප්‍රකාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4652_236971_634340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software that was installed on the system without user's consent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="236971">unwanted software</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634340">අනවශ්‍ය මෘදුකාංග</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><te