</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46717_2628469_2634612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The open authentication standard developed by the FIDO Alliance which allows online services to strengthen the security of their existing password infrastructure by adding a strong second factor to sign in. The user signs in with the user name and password and then is required to present a second factor device for secure authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2628469">Universal 2nd Factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2634612">U2F</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46717_2628469_2634613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The open authentication standard developed by the FIDO Alliance which allows online services to strengthen the security of their existing password infrastructure by adding a strong second factor to sign in. The user signs in with the user name and password and then is required to present a second factor device for secure authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2628469">Universal 2nd Factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2634613">විශ්ව 2වන සාධකය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lang