etworks, L2TP traffic is sent as User Datagram Protocol (UDP) messages. In Microsoft operating systems, L2TP is used in conjunction with Internet Protocol security (IPSec) as a virtual private network (VPN) technology to provide remote access or router-to-router VPN connections. L2TP is described in RFC 2661.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318115">L2TP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634880">දෙවන ස්තර උමං තරණ ප්‍රොටොකෝලය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5162_25316_635548"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that provides goods and/or services to others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25316">business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635548">ව්‍යාපාරය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5172_20576_635292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The speed at which a modem transmits data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20576">baud</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="635292">බෝඩ්</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><