Number">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8152_29615_1368722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The certification authority which issued the certificate to the subject.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="29615">certificate issuer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1368722">සහතික නිකුත් කරන්නා</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8156_232394_634523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Appears to the left of a meeting or appointment (or all the way around the item when selected), indicating time status as free, tentative, busy, out of office, or no information available. Visible only in Day and Work Week view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232394">availability indicator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="si-LK"><ntig><termGrp><term id="634523">උපයෝජන දර්ශකය</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LKA</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8160_16016_634401"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To include an external document, a file, or an executable program with a message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="16016">attach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></n